<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Welcooome! The <STYLE ID="1">young lady with April sickness</STYLE>!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "イエローカメラ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had only just been seen off, I suppose. In the entrance, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> was already standing.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Really, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, don't drag me back to reality."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Ahaha, sorry, sorry! But you seem to be doing pretty well today."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, today I'm fine!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家台所1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Sit anywhere, I'm brewing tea now. High-class stuff from La France, apparently."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ooh, so this is what they call hospitality. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And me, I brought this!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Let's see, let's see, chocolate and sakiika. [TN: dried shredded squid, sold as a snack]
{PAUSE ""}
I see... so for high-class tea it has to be sakiika, doesn't it―
{PAUSE ""}
―as if it does! No chance!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That is one dead-straight play-along retort...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\DVD.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "C" "600" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"And, look! The DVD!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Ah! This is the one we went to see together last year! You bought it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. Apparently the DVD has the parts that got cut from the film in it too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oho, well now, well now. It has been a long time."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> turned to the DVD and made a deep bow.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Today </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> is in remarkably high spirits.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But I know this is </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> looking out for me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In this season my mood tends to sink.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">To let me feel even a little cheerful, this is </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">'s own hospitality, over and above the tea.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Ah, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, could you get the teacups?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, yes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\食器を動かす.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I took teacups for the two of us and set them down beside the gas ring the kettle was on.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Come to think of it, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, what did your notice about the closure say?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"The email said it was a notification from the police."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Same as my class. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I've wondered for a while, but isn't this the kind of thing they email out to the whole school?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, that's what <STYLE ID="2">my mom</STYLE> was saying, but it's to spread out the contact points."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Spread-out-the-contact-points...? What's that?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"If they mailed the whole school at once, our side would all try to put questions to the sender, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　So then dealing with it gets rough, so they mail it class by class and have you contact your homeroom teacher direct."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Is that... efficient?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I dunno, myself..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The wording probably differs from teacher to teacher, but is that all right...?"</STYLE><PG>
"If it's running fine this way, isn't that good enough?
{PAUSE ""}
　Ah, right, the content of the email that came round to my class."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hm, for safety, don't go outside, it said."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"For... safety?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s email had no wording like </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="・・・・・">for safety</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> in it.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"So that means 'outside is dangerous', doesn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When I said that, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">'s hands stopped dead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"That... does follow. So it's not an accident but an incident after all?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That keyed-up voice of </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">'s dropped an octave.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"And on top of that, if the danger is still there, that means..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Naturally my own voice dropped too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Terrorism or something? <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ま">Spread</STYLE>ing poison gas around."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"In a town of a measly 40,000 people? And even then they'd put out an evacuation order, surely... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe a wanted criminal has fled in here?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Then maybe they've taken a hostage so they can get away?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The happy mood of a moment before was turning subtly hard.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Sorry, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, just to be sure, go and check the lock on the front door."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家ドア閉.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I went to the entrance, checked that the door was locked, and then, for extra safety,</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">put the chain on as well.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家台所1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"It was fine, the locks are all set."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Thanks! <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, did you lock up properly when you left your place?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, my place is fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> picked up the kettle, now hot, and poured the water into the teapot.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">How shall I put it, the atmosphere was odd.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When I went out with the trash earlier, I felt a slightly tense air then too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What is happening in this town―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Here! Take the tea over, would you!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> put on a bright voice, as though trying to break this hardened air.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\食器を動かす.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">I set the tea down on the living-room table and sat on the sofa.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\DVD.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "C" "600" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Right, let's watch it!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> had my DVD in her hand before I noticed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Next to the TV was a laptop,</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\DVDドライブへ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">and the DVD was put into the disc drive.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It is set up so that the picture goes from the computer to the TV.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="3">'s house is always like this when we watch a DVD or go surfing the net, with the computer up on the big screen.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">When I looked at the clock, 8:30 a.m.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Normally it is the time I get to school.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="3">, once she had finished with the controls, sat well back on the sofa and pressed herself right up against me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\映画.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\映画.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">While we watched the DVD, we did not talk at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was not that today's odd air had swallowed us up; we were purely absorbed in the DVD.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Though </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> did suck on the sakiika the whole way through...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―3 hours later, the end credits on the screen.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Right to the very end, both of us were able to soak in the world of the DVD.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "イエローカメラ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Ahh, that was good! It really is the best!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Now I've seen the cut parts, it finally feels like it adds up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I know, I know! Why did they cut it for the film?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"All the same, the heroine really was cute."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Heh! She sure was!
{PAUSE ""}
　'Be reborn a pure demon! Devil Justice!'"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And with that, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> did the heroine's impression and snapped into a pose.</STYLE><PG>
